  <activityDataset>
    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="79dc7273-371e-583c-990e-192055103403" activityNameId="4f8cde74-d52e-5d4c-b587-66cc6b1a57e8" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Aircraft, long haul</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Aircraft, long haul
Material consumption values refer to the production of one average aircraft in the referring class  (net weight 240t). Interventions for manufacturing processes of vehicles are derived from specific exchanges per seat. (380 seats/unit). Data represent 16 European sites of Airbus.;
UUID: 307d6faf-444b-3a9e-bbc9-2964f02d4685
The inventory includes  processes of  material, energy and water use in vehicle manufacturing. Also, VOC emissions are accounted for. Rail and road transport of materials are considered. Plant infrastructure is not included. Energy consumption for de-ionised water is included in the electricty value. Material expenditures are not accounted for. Transport of vehicle parts between the different sites is excluded.
Location: Vehicle manufacturing data are taken from 16 production site in  Germany, France, Spain and the UK 
Technology: Current production technology, environmental issues have been addressed in the past.
Time period: undefined
Production volume:  50% of the world wide commercial airliner orders.
Sampling: Manufacturing data is taken from an environmental report of 16 production site. Additional data was generated via oral communication.  
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_307d6faf-444b-3a9e-bbc9-2964f02d4685.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
      <geography geographyId="20a9bf48-6cea-59b4-ad08-000cb981f2d0" geographyContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83">
